OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's Christmas lights return
OL,4,Aafter campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and residents have raised
OL,7,Fthousands of pounds for new Christmas
OL,8,Flights to return "festive cheer" to
OL,9,Ftheir community.
OL,11,FCrownhill village in Plymouth has not
OL,12,Fbeen illuminated during the festive
OL,13,Fperiod for the last two years, as its
OL,14,Fold lights were unfit for use and
OL,15,Fneeded replacing.
OL,17,FRalph Delbridge, chairman of the
OL,18,FCrownhill Village Committee, said: "A
OL,19,Ffew of us came together because we
OL,20,Fwanted to see the lights return to
OL,21,FCrownhill village and bring back a
OL,22,Flittle festive cheer."
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
