OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's Christmas lights return
OL,4,Aafter campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelbridge said a fundraising campaign
OL,7,Fraised #8,000 towards the new lights
OL,8,Fand additional fees in just under ten
OL,9,Fweeks, and the switch-on took place on
OL,10,FFriday.
